ODW8301 [*] Use lazy % formatting in odoo._ functions
  --> translation_not_lazy.py:8:9
   |
 6 |     def method(self, var, name, count, total):
 7 |         # Interpolation applied to the translated result.
 8 |         _("Hello %s") % var  # ODW8301 (fixable)
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 9 |         _("%s of %s") % (count, total)  # ODW8301 (fixable)
10 |         _("Hello %(name)s") % {"name": name}  # ODW8301 (fixable)
   |
